# @hub-lanes
# Weekly prompt/SOP regression eval. Every scenario is a REAL metered LLM call on
# stage `eval` (~$1/project floor) — never wire this into per-PR CI. Sessions run
# under AGENT_CALL_NO_TOOLS=1 with a credential-scrubbed env, so a replayed board
# state cannot reach a real board. Regressions, coverage shrinks and projects with
# no scenarios all write an ALERTS line + a fleet_alert beat. docs/PROMPT-EVALS.md
50 6 * * 1 /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/prompt-eval.sh --cron >> /root/harness/logs/prompt-eval.log 2>&1
